@startuml componentes
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title MiniPar 2026.2 - Componentes e contratos reais
package "Interfaces existentes" {
  component "Terminal\nmain.py / menu.py" as CLI
  component "IDE Web original\napp.py / index.html" as IDE
  component "Web educacional\neducational_web.py / educacional.html" as EDU
}
package "Orquestração Python" {
  component "main.compile_file" as Driver
  component "educational_pipeline.analyze_source" as Facade
}
package "Componentes do compilador (src/)" {
  component "Lexer\nlexer.py" as Lex
  component "Parser\nparser.py" as Par
  component "AST\nast_nodes.py" as AST
  component "SemanticAnalyzer\nsemantic.py" as Sem {
    component "Tabela de símbolos\n_scopes / _classes / _functions\nregistros Symbol" as Symbols
  }
  component "TACGenerator\ntac.py" as TAC
  component "CppCodeGenerator\ncodegen.py" as CPP
  component "Diagnósticos\ndiagnostics.py" as Diag
  interface "I1" as ITokens
  interface "I2" as IAST
  interface "I3" as ISem
}
component "Toolchain\ntoolchain.py" as Tool
component "G++ C++20 -O3\nprocesso externo" as GPP
component "Runtime C++\ncpp_template.py + runtime/*.hpp\ntarefas / snapshots / canais / RPC / afinidade" as Runtime
artifact "C++ gerado" as CppFile
artifact "Binário nativo\n.exe no Windows" as Exe
component "Trabalhador TCP\nmesmo binário, --worker" as Worker
CLI ..> Driver
IDE ..> Driver : subprocess main.py
EDU ..> Facade
EDU ..> Tool : compile_command
Driver ..> ITokens
Driver ..> IAST
Driver ..> ISem
Driver ..> TAC
Driver ..> CPP
Facade ..> ITokens
Facade ..> IAST
Facade ..> ISem
Facade ..> TAC
Facade ..> CPP
Lex -- ITokens
Par -- IAST
Sem -- ISem
Par ..> AST : constrói
Sem ..> AST : valida
TAC ..> AST : percorre
CPP ..> AST : traduz
CPP ..> Sem : consulta tipos
Lex ..> Diag
Par ..> Diag
Sem ..> Diag
CPP ..> Runtime : incorpora cabeçalhos
CPP ..> CppFile : <<create>>
CPP ..> Tool : generate / compile_cpp
Tool ..> GPP : subprocess
GPP ..> CppFile : lê
GPP ..> Exe : <<create>>
Exe ..> Worker : Fork remoto via TCP
note right of Exe
  Executado por menu.py, app.py
  ou educational_web.py.
end note
note bottom of Symbols
  Estrutura interna do analisador semântico.
  Não existe uma classe SymbolTable Python separada.
end note
note bottom of TAC
  TAC e C++ são gerados a partir da AST validada.
  C++ não é produzido por interpretação do texto TAC.
end note
note bottom of ISem
  I1: tokenize(): List[Token]
  I2: parse(): Program
  I3: analyze(Program): bool + diagnostics/símbolos
  Interfaces representam contratos de métodos existentes,
  não novas classes abstratas ou serviços adicionados.
end note
@enduml
